    {
      "id": "claim_076a5eb93c35465a96df8d50dceeb2b0",
      "statement": "The raw `zotero-plugin test` prints \"Test run completed\" but keeps the Zotero test instance (and itself) alive, so scripts/run-zotero-tests.mjs wraps it: it matches \"Test run completed - …\" in the accumulated child stdout/stderr, stops only the test instance via ZOTERO_PLUGIN_KILL_COMMAND, exits 0 on zero failures / 1 on a failure or a missing result line / 2 on timeout (finish is idempotent and delays process.exit 300 ms), and aborts without a result after FLEXANNOTATE_TEST_LIMIT_MS milliseconds (default 240000) because the suite is slower on older Zotero versions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/run-zotero-tests.mjs#L1-L8",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5ddc93412d7e326804b9c3aa3b1437aa0338133842fbeadb7326a3e1c5d502f5:"
